  "notes": "USAGE: {飛行|ひこう} is the formal term for flying or flight, commonly used in aviation contexts.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{飛行|ひこう}する (to fly)\n・{飛行|ひこう}{中|ちゅう} (during flight)\n・{飛行|ひこう}を{禁止|きんし}する (to prohibit flight)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n・{飛行機|ひこうき} (airplane)\n・{飛行場|ひこうじょう} (airport, airfield)\n・{飛行|ひこう}{時間|じかん} (flight time)\n・{飛行|ひこう}{距離|きょり} (flight distance)\n・{飛行|ひこう}{士|し} (pilot - formal)\n・{試験|しけん}{飛行|ひこう} (test flight)\n・{有人|ゆうじん}{飛行|ひこう} (manned flight)\n・{宇宙|うちゅう}{飛行|ひこう}{士|し} (astronaut)\n\nHOMOPHONE:\n・{非行|ひこう} (delinquency, misconduct) - different meaning",
